# The Windows server is committed whole, so a clone runs as is: FMPServer.exe, libnode.dll,
# crashpad_handler.exe, server.json and the built resources (dist/).
# Left out: the game client, the Linux server, the spare gamemode copy, and anything the server
# generates or that holds player data.

# FMP release parts we do not run from this repo
/client/
/server-linux/
/fmp-resources/

# generated at runtime
/server/logs/
/server/.packages/
/server/fmp-data/
/server/game-data/
*.log
crashpad*/

# dependencies: only needed to build, not to run
node_modules/
